From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:26:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] interfaces: Add the AIDL touchfeature interface

The touch HAL Xiaomi ships on newer devices serves
vendor.xiaomi.hw.touchfeature.ITouchFeature/default over AIDL. Describe
it for Java clients; the service and its NDK library are prebuilts.

Change-Id: I85475e228b0d438d61e805a2b9de7148a181bdfb
